              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ChilePepper"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was born in the US, but both parents are Chileans-- this recipe is perfect! The right combo of sweet-sour with a foamy top. Most pisco sours are just \"pisco margaritas\", not sour and not frothy. Many people skip the egg white -- and miss out on the full effect ..."
