              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Rocio"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have been in both countries in Chile they use a kind of what they call Pisco...very different from the peruvian one...different grape!!!!!!!! I have to say ...better the peruvian Pisco..... sorry if you can find peruvian Pisco...you will see the difference!!!!",
